# ==============================================================================
# Allowed Sender Emails (/etc/postfix/allowed_senders)
# Copy this file to config/allowed_senders to add allowed senders in addition
# to the ALLOWED_SENDERS variable in .env.
# ==============================================================================
#
# Syntax:
#   sender@company.com      OK
#
# Examples:
otp@company.com             OK
notification@company.com    OK
# alert@company.com         OK
# noreply@company.com       OK
